                "description": "The Concord 1-1/2 x 11 Inch American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim with 3-5/8 Inch c.c. is for use on Jeldwen and Marvin brand patio doors with a multipoint lock mechanism already installed. This patio door handleset features an american cylinder above the lever. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The Arched Concord Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Above Handle is customizable. Choose your lever and finish color from a wide array of choices ranging from classic to contemporary for a look that is all your own.",
